  <div class="sqs-html-content" data-sqsp-text-block-content><h4 style="white-space:pre-wrap;" data-rte-preserve-empty="true"><strong>Acoustical Society of America, Philadelphia Meeting, 11-15 May 2026.</strong></h4><p class="" style="white-space:pre-wrap;" data-rte-preserve-empty="true">The 190th Meeting of the Acoustical Society of America was held at the Philadelphia Marriott Downtown Hotel, 11-15 May 2026. For additional information, go to the <a href="https://acousticalsociety.org/philadelphia/">Philadelphia Meeting Information Page</a>.</p></div>


  
