</div></div></div><div class="fe-block fe-block-7b83daea9a905ff93b80"><div class="sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block sqs-background-enabled" data-block-css="[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/fa064889-35e4-452f-a442-609281306ad6_586/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]" data-block-scripts="[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/fa064889-35e4-452f-a442-609281306ad6_586/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]" data-block-type="1337" data-definition-name="website.components.html" data-sqsp-block="text" data-website-component-id="7b83daea9a905ff93b80" id="block-7b83daea9a905ff93b80"><div class="sqs-block-content"><div class="sqs-text-block-container">
  
  <div class="sqs-html-content" data-sqsp-text-block-content><h4 style="white-space:pre-wrap;" data-rte-preserve-empty="true"><a href="/seminarseries">Haskins Seminar Series</a>.</h4><p class="" style="white-space:pre-wrap;" data-rte-preserve-empty="true">The most recent Haskins Seminar took place on Thursday, <strong>April 23, 2026, at 3:30 PM</strong>., featuring <a href="https://education.uconn.edu/person/laura-steacy/">Dr. Laura Steacy</a> from the University of CT. This seminar was held in-person (UConn Waterbury, MPR-Rm 119) and virtually (MS Teams).  </p><p class="" style="white-space:pre-wrap;" data-rte-preserve-empty="true">For additional details, please refer to <a target="_blank" href="/s/HaskinsSeminarFlyer_LauraSteacy_Final.pdf">the meeting flyer</a>. If you have any questions, feel free to contact Ken Pugh at <a href="mailto:Kenneth.pugh@uconn.edu">Kenneth.pugh@uconn.edu</a> or email <a href="mailto:HaskinsGlobal@uconn.edu">HaskinsGlobal@uconn.edu</a>. </p></div>


  
